<p>This will allow us to use the <code>RefreshDatabase</code> trait to reset the database before each test, ensuring a clean slate for testing.</p>
<blockquote>
<p>It is important to note that the <code>RefreshDatabase</code> trait will clear the database before each test, so make sure to use a separate database for testing to avoid data loss as the database will be reset for each test meaning that any data that you have in the database will be lost.</p>
</blockquote>
